# Keeps Cursor's AI features and codebase indexing away from these files.
# Claude Code doesn't read this file; CLAUDE.md's privacy rules cover it.

# ESPN cookies (.env.espn.local) and the Vercel token (.env.local)
.env*
# Template only, no real values
!.env.espn.local.example

# Raw ESPN captures carry members' personal info
data/**/raw/
*.raw.json

# The throwaway week-ahead capture
data/*/next-week/
